Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.67,0:00:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是白河同学的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,男朋友!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,啥?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,人家说了那种话喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.69,0:00:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这太扯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,居然跟加岛那种人交往
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,白河同学人根本超好的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.65,0:00:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,白河同学果然是天使
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶  我要再告白一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.99,0:00:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她要男朋友包养她的传闻是假的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  阿加
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:00:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,黑濑同学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,散布白河同学传闻的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.61,0:01:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是黑濑同学对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是的话又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.57,0:01:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意告诉我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.49,0:01:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要做那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我想当第一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我…不想再被那女人夺走任何东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.83,0:01:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,白河月爱是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.63,0:01:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我的双胞胎姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Comment: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,咦? 总觉得我好奇怪
Comment: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没有过 这样的感觉
Comment: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,每当感受到你的温柔 为什么呢?
Comment: 0,0:01:55.57,0:01:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胸口就会感到难受
Comment: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,相互交叠
Comment: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐混合
Comment: 0,0:02:02.75,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,已经无论如何都无法停止了(无法!)
Comment: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,被烟火的光线给照亮的
Comment: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你的侧脸
Comment: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,人家正盯着你呢
Comment: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌暧昧 待在我身边
Comment: 0,0:02:22.93,0:02:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,(一直一直 待在我身边)
Comment: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是恋爱吧
Comment: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让我了解这感觉的
Comment: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,(这是你带给我的感觉)
Comment: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对象是我真的可以吗?
Comment: 0,0:02:39.03,0:02:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,(对象是我真的可以吗?)
Comment: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知所措又无法更进一步 真是的…
Comment: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,忐忑不安又闪闪发光的现在
Comment: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐染上可爱色彩的世界
Comment: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:03:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,双  双胞胎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是真的吧
Comment: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
